# The repo root .gitignore has a blanket `*.png` rule (it exists to keep stray
# screenshots and scraped page images out of history). The PWA icons are source,
# not output: without them the installed home-screen app has no icon and Chrome
# will not offer "Add to Home screen" at all. Un-ignore exactly those four files
# and nothing else — any other .png dropped in here stays ignored.
!icon-192.png
!icon-512.png
!icon-maskable-512.png
!apple-touch-icon.png
